WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.240 --> 01:41.240
[Episode 6]

3
01:43.320 --> 01:47.377
This is the agreement to cancel the alliance and order all troops back to their posts.

4
01:47.377 --> 01:51.560
And this is the appointment for the 9th Corps' new commander.

5
01:51.560 --> 01:53.033
I'll trouble you, Commander-in-Chief.

6
01:57.920 --> 02:03.579
"To appoint Yu Chang Xuan as the Commander of the 9th Corps."

7
02:08.560 --> 02:13.400
You're appointing yourself the new commander of the 9th Corps?

8
02:13.400 --> 02:15.046
And you want me to sign it?

9
02:17.240 --> 02:21.113
I'm the best man for the position.

10
02:21.840 --> 02:24.276
You've got some nerve!

11
02:24.276 --> 02:27.879
I'm telling you, no matter the reason,

12
02:27.879 --> 02:31.080
forcing your superior amounts to mutiny.

13
02:31.080 --> 02:32.360
That's a capital offense.

14
02:32.360 --> 02:35.953
Even if you shoot me, I'll still do it.

15
02:39.319 --> 02:40.920
Fine.

16
02:40.920 --> 02:45.626
You've been putting up a front with me since you were a kid, never once slipping up.

17
02:46.599 --> 02:48.799
You were good at it.

18
02:53.040 --> 02:54.621
It's not that I was acting.

19
02:55.320 --> 02:59.853
From the start, Yu Ming Xuan was the only one you ever cared about.

20
03:01.840 --> 03:03.926
Did you ever once look at me?

21
03:06.039 --> 03:09.300
What's wrong with having high hopes for your brother?

22
03:10.240 --> 03:13.326
He had talent and spirit from the time he was young.

23
03:13.326 --> 03:15.080
He wasn't afraid of hard work,

24
03:15.080 --> 03:17.720
so he could carry the Yu family's honor.

25
03:17.720 --> 03:19.360
As the eldest son,

26
03:19.360 --> 03:22.680
he cared for his parents and younger siblings.

27
03:22.680 --> 03:28.000
If he were here today, he would never let you defy your old man.

28
03:28.000 --> 03:30.419
What do you have to compare to him?

29
03:37.000 --> 03:38.299
Indeed.

30
03:41.760 --> 03:43.499
What was wrong with my brother?

31
03:47.400 --> 03:49.300
He was perfect in every way.

32
03:51.039 --> 03:52.786
But so what?

33
03:55.000 --> 03:56.766
Heaven had no mercy.

34
03:58.439 --> 04:03.380
The son you were most proud of is dead.

35
04:16.760 --> 04:18.493
The battle at Heishi Shoal...

36
04:19.480 --> 04:21.379
You must have hated how it turned out.

37
04:24.600 --> 04:26.726
You saved Ming Xuan.

38
04:29.439 --> 04:34.740
So why did he die and not me?

39
04:38.120 --> 04:39.700
How did you find out?

40
04:43.400 --> 04:45.446
Were you going to keep it from me forever?

41
05:01.000 --> 05:03.360
- Somebody help! - Help! Help!

42
05:03.360 --> 05:05.319
Got a man down here! Bring the stretcher over!

43
05:05.319 --> 05:07.800
- Ming Xuan! Ming Xuan! - Stretcher!

44
05:07.800 --> 05:10.044
Ming Xuan!

45
05:10.044 --> 05:12.120
Commander, Master Chang Xuan's over here!

46
05:12.120 --> 05:14.040
Commander, Master Chang Xuan's over here!

47
05:14.040 --> 05:15.960
[Yu Chang Xuan, 17 years old] Get the rocks off him. Quick!

48
05:15.960 --> 05:18.320
Commander, we've got the Corps Commander out.

49
05:19.680 --> 05:20.900
Catch him!

50
05:21.560 --> 05:23.920
Commander, it's getting bad.

51
05:23.920 --> 05:25.240
We have to retreat now!

52
05:25.240 --> 05:27.920
Whatever happens. Saving Ming Xuan comes first!

53
05:27.920 --> 05:29.160
Get him out of here!

54
05:29.160 --> 05:31.220
- Hurry! - Hurry!

55
05:38.399 --> 05:40.083
We have another casualty here!

56
05:40.083 --> 05:41.340
Wait.

57
05:48.560 --> 05:51.459
So you were already awake back then.

58
05:53.560 --> 05:57.939
And all these years, you never said a word.

59
06:01.360 --> 06:05.900
Some things are better left unsaid, if we want to stay father and son.

60
06:09.120 --> 06:11.180
I won't explain myself.

61
06:12.560 --> 06:16.026
I did choose to save your brother back then,

62
06:18.480 --> 06:23.199
but I had no choice given the situation.

63
06:23.199 --> 06:24.540
It doesn't matter.

64
06:32.240 --> 06:34.221
I've gotten used to your coldness.

65
06:39.000 --> 06:40.461
What I'm saying is,

66
06:41.280 --> 06:44.360
I'm going to make the 9th Corps new.

67
06:44.360 --> 06:46.315
As long as you give the nod,

68
06:46.315 --> 06:48.246
we can still be a loving father and a dutiful son.

69
06:48.906 --> 06:51.245
You'll still be the father I respect most.

70
06:56.360 --> 06:59.080
If you back out on the allied army matter,

71
07:00.160 --> 07:03.020
Chu Wen Fu won't let it go.

72
07:03.020 --> 07:05.933
I've thought this through. That's why I dare to do it.

73
07:06.640 --> 07:08.926
If Chu Wen Fu dares to make a move,

74
07:08.926 --> 07:12.633
I'll handle whatever he stirs up, inside and out.

75
07:26.343 --> 07:28.893
[Appoint Yu Chang Xuan as Commander of the 9th Corps]

76
07:33.320 --> 07:38.126
[Chu Wen Fu, Governor of Sujing Region]

77
07:45.520 --> 07:49.686
Governor, after Yu Zhong Quan was attacked, he sent word to cancel the alliance.

78
08:15.920 --> 08:17.693
What's this crap?

79
08:19.480 --> 08:23.220
A girl from some no-name family, trying to act all cultured?

80
08:25.920 --> 08:27.800
What do you want?

81
08:27.800 --> 08:30.379
Master Chang Xuan and Zi Yi are back together.

82
08:31.320 --> 08:34.280
You were just a pawn he used to make Zi Yi jealous.

83
08:34.960 --> 08:38.213
Have some shame and stop trying to marry into the Yu family.

84
08:40.560 --> 08:42.360
Ye Ping Jun,

85
08:42.360 --> 08:46.781
the most important thing is knowing your place.

86
08:53.120 --> 08:54.320
True.

87
08:54.955 --> 08:58.639
They two are a match made in hell, and you're no different.

88
08:58.639 --> 09:00.240
Mind your own business.

89
09:00.240 --> 09:01.600
- You dare insult Zi Yi? - You dare curse at us?

90
09:01.600 --> 09:03.840
- You're not going anywhere! - Stay here!

91
09:03.840 --> 09:05.120
Let go!

92
09:28.480 --> 09:33.080
Chang Xuan, word about canceling the army alliance shocked the old generals.

93
09:33.080 --> 09:36.640
There's all sorts of speculation, and they're up in arms.

94
09:46.800 --> 09:48.533
Let them make noise.

95
09:51.000 --> 09:53.160
What's Chu Wen Fu's reaction?

96
09:54.040 --> 09:55.440
Just as you expected.

97
09:55.440 --> 10:00.100
Chu Wen Fu has already sent two brigades advancing toward the Lishui border.

98
10:02.840 --> 10:05.760
Trouble! Trouble! A big trouble!

99
10:05.760 --> 10:07.960
This time it's really big!

100
10:07.960 --> 10:09.680
What's the panic?

101
10:09.680 --> 10:11.353
It's Miss Ye.

102
10:13.080 --> 10:14.404
What happened to her?

103
10:14.404 --> 10:17.019
The Tao family has taken Miss Ye.

104
10:28.080 --> 10:31.440
So young and already so vicious.

105
10:31.440 --> 10:33.639
You dared to hurt my daughter's face?

106
10:33.639 --> 10:35.580
That's a dirty move!

107
10:37.560 --> 10:40.320
If she hadn't deliberately stirred trouble,

108
10:40.320 --> 10:41.680
she wouldn't have gotten hurt.

109
10:41.680 --> 10:45.280
How dare you talk back to me? You should be on your knees apologizing to my daughter,

110
10:45.280 --> 10:47.160
and even that wouldn't be enough.

111
10:47.160 --> 10:49.617
Clearly your parents never taught you any manners.

112
10:49.617 --> 10:52.933
I'll teach you some myself today.

113
11:28.240 --> 11:29.880
Are you sorry?

114
11:37.960 --> 11:39.620
I did nothing wrong.

115
11:41.760 --> 11:46.720
I tried to give you an easy way out, yet you wouldn't take it.

116
11:46.720 --> 11:48.220
Don't blame me...

117
11:55.360 --> 11:56.541
Master.

118
11:57.280 --> 11:59.219
There are soldiers coming!

119
12:04.000 --> 12:05.280
Put down your guns.

120
12:12.320 --> 12:16.339
You're one of Yu Chang Xuan's men, aren't you?

121
12:21.720 --> 12:22.740
You...

122
12:44.040 --> 12:45.280
Stop right there.

123
12:46.920 --> 12:48.600
She hurt my daughter's face.

124
12:48.600 --> 12:51.560
No one is taking her away from here today.

125
12:51.560 --> 12:53.946
I have to take her today.

126
12:53.946 --> 12:56.085
How dare you speak to me like that?

127
12:57.360 --> 13:00.259
Is this Yu Chang Xuan's order?

128
13:05.640 --> 13:08.996
Miss Ye is a copyist for Miss Lan Qing at the Yuchun Opera House.

129
13:08.996 --> 13:11.486
I was asked to bring her back.

130
13:12.200 --> 13:15.980
A mere opera singer dares to get in my way?

131
13:15.980 --> 13:19.760
President Tao, you abducted a young woman and mete out your own brand of justice.

132
13:19.760 --> 13:21.240
If anyone looks into this,

133
13:21.240 --> 13:23.220
it could damage the Tao family's reputation.

134
13:24.840 --> 13:27.080
She hurt my daughter's face! You think I'll let that slide?

135
13:27.080 --> 13:28.920
Then I'd better take her back

136
13:28.920 --> 13:31.760
and get to the bottom of it to make sure you get a satisfactory answer.

137
13:33.279 --> 13:34.379
You!

138
13:46.720 --> 13:47.980
Move out.

139
14:01.800 --> 14:04.381
Good thing I got word in time, right?

140
14:06.000 --> 14:08.840
I know you're just playing around with Ye Ping Jun.

141
14:08.840 --> 14:12.659
You're not really falling out with the Tao family over some schoolgirl, are you?

142
14:14.320 --> 14:17.093
She got dragged into this because of us.

143
14:17.720 --> 14:21.320
I'm returning the favor.

144
14:21.320 --> 14:24.093
Since when did you get so kind-hearted?

145
14:25.880 --> 14:27.180
Drive.

146
14:45.960 --> 14:48.857
Bing Wen, when is the Commander-in-Chief arriving?

147
14:48.857 --> 14:50.440
I mentioned it to him this morning.

148
14:50.440 --> 14:51.460
Please wait a bit longer.

149
14:52.040 --> 14:54.320
Why break the alliance agreement?

150
14:54.320 --> 14:59.073
Right now, two full brigades of the Chu Army are on the Lishui border,

151
14:59.073 --> 15:01.166
setting up machine guns and digging trenches.

152
15:01.760 --> 15:04.784
They're clearly about to open fire.

153
15:04.784 --> 15:08.160
Fight, and it means we're opposing the Governor.

154
15:08.160 --> 15:12.320
But if we don't, are we going to hand over our troops for nothing?

155
15:12.320 --> 15:14.039
- Fight. - We have to fight!

156
15:14.039 --> 15:15.899
- We must fight! - Fight.

157
15:18.040 --> 15:20.289
Please calm down--

158
15:20.289 --> 15:21.639
Shut up!

159
15:21.639 --> 15:25.639
I have troops quartered at Lishui, don't you know that?

160
15:25.639 --> 15:30.560
You pompous pen-pushers. All you do is hide in your offices.

161
15:30.560 --> 15:31.930
Feng San Li!

162
15:31.930 --> 15:36.440
This isn't your backyard where you can shout and scream.

163
15:36.440 --> 15:38.196
Guns and cannons settle arguments,

164
15:38.196 --> 15:40.799
and we're the ones who die for it.

165
15:40.799 --> 15:44.960
Who's to say the Chu Army won't fire first?

166
15:44.960 --> 15:48.577
Or that the Yu Army won't take losses?

167
15:48.577 --> 15:52.879
Or that the Chu Army won't take Nanhuai?

168
15:52.879 --> 15:54.019
I am.

169
16:13.880 --> 16:15.960
- Master Chang Xuan. - What's Master Chang Xuan doing here?

170
16:15.960 --> 16:18.280
- Why isn't the Commander-in-Chief here? - What's he here for?

171
16:18.280 --> 16:20.480
- Right. - Shouldn't the Commander-in-Chief be here?

172
16:36.840 --> 16:40.021
I'm chairing today's meeting.

173
16:46.440 --> 16:47.700
Sit.

174
16:57.120 --> 17:01.279
Master Chang Xuan, you're joking with us, right?

175
17:01.279 --> 17:03.299
This is a military meeting.

176
17:04.200 --> 17:06.964
By the Commander-in-Chief's appointment, effective today,

177
17:06.964 --> 17:09.480
I'm the commander of the 9th Corps.

178
17:09.480 --> 17:10.970
The Commander-in-Chief is unwell.

179
17:10.970 --> 17:15.813
For the next two months, I'll handle all military affairs on his behalf.

180
17:17.160 --> 17:19.359
Why would the Commander-in-Chief leave it to Master Chang Xuan?

181
17:19.359 --> 17:24.380
I've made a plan to deal with the Chu Army at Lishui.

182
17:27.715 --> 17:30.200
Chang Xuan, you know opera.

183
17:30.200 --> 17:33.299
But how much do you know about running an army?

184
17:35.600 --> 17:40.040
Chu Wen Fu will withdraw before 10 o'clock.

185
17:40.040 --> 17:41.720
- 10 o'clock? - Withdraw?

186
17:41.720 --> 17:43.200
I don't believe it.

187
17:43.200 --> 17:45.400
Exactly. The Chu Army went to all that trouble.

188
17:45.400 --> 17:47.570
Why would they turn back with nothing?

189
17:47.570 --> 17:48.720
Then let's make a bet.

190
17:48.720 --> 17:52.039
Fine. If you lose, go back to the General Staff.

191
17:52.039 --> 17:54.960
If you win, I'll acknowledge you as the Commander.

192
17:54.960 --> 17:56.099
Deal.

193
18:04.255 --> 18:05.880
[Conference Room]

194
18:05.880 --> 18:09.599
How could Governor Chu just up and pull out?

195
18:09.599 --> 18:11.040
The alliance is a done deal.

196
18:11.040 --> 18:13.040
- How could he withdraw? - I don't see it.

197
18:20.793 --> 18:22.440
Reporting to Brigade Commander Feng.

198
18:22.440 --> 18:23.700
Come in.

199
18:26.559 --> 18:28.520
Brigade Commander, a telegram from Lishui

200
18:28.520 --> 18:30.960
said the Chu Army's 3rd Corps is moving up along the Lishui River.

201
18:30.960 --> 18:32.170
Well?

202
18:32.170 --> 18:34.591
Is this your so-called withdrawal?

203
18:35.440 --> 18:38.360
Brigade Commander, Chu's army isn't advancing.

204
18:38.360 --> 18:40.960
They're withdrawing toward Jinzhou.

205
18:40.960 --> 18:42.079
So they did pull out.

206
18:42.079 --> 18:44.599
- How did Master Chang Xuan know? - Yeah, how did he know?

207
18:44.599 --> 18:47.200
- Yeah. - How did Master Chang Xuan find out?

208
18:47.200 --> 18:48.319
Withdraw?

209
18:51.080 --> 18:52.139
Get out!

210
18:53.480 --> 18:56.220
Brigade Commander Feng, please sit.

211
19:02.680 --> 19:04.497
Master Cheng has already found out.

212
19:04.497 --> 19:07.319
Chu Wen Fu used the Allied Army as cover

213
19:07.319 --> 19:11.079
to transfer the Yu Army's elite troops and secretly build up his own forces.

214
19:11.079 --> 19:15.360
Master Cheng personally sent a telegram ordering him to stop.

215
19:15.360 --> 19:16.780
Chu Wen Fu didn't dare refuse.

216
19:17.520 --> 19:20.280
Master Cheng is far away in Huaijing Prefecture.

217
19:20.280 --> 19:22.139
How would he know what went down here?

218
19:23.279 --> 19:24.440
So Chu Wen Fu really...

219
19:24.440 --> 19:25.720
How would he know?

220
19:25.720 --> 19:27.373
Yeah, how?

221
19:29.400 --> 19:33.886
Even if he pulls back his army, you've got on his bad side.

222
19:33.886 --> 19:35.480
Master Chang Xuan,

223
19:35.480 --> 19:38.420
I wonder how you are going to deal with it?

224
19:39.120 --> 19:42.277
The political situation in the central government is shifting every day.

225
19:42.277 --> 19:45.456
The Cheng and Xu armies are at war, and no one knows who'll come out on top.

226
19:46.320 --> 19:48.796
If the Yu Army rushes to pick sides,

227
19:48.796 --> 19:51.235
are we supposed to sink or swim with whoever we back?

228
19:51.235 --> 19:55.039
Even if we back the right horse, how long does the glory last?

229
19:55.039 --> 19:56.380
Generals,

230
19:57.200 --> 20:03.061
you fought bloody battles to carve out this territory.

231
20:04.079 --> 20:07.380
Is it only good enough to scrape by in the cracks?

232
20:08.000 --> 20:10.030
What the Yu Army wants

233
20:10.030 --> 20:15.339
and what I, Yu Chang Xuan, want is not to cling to others, but to stand on our own.

234
20:25.560 --> 20:28.240
Governor, under Master Cheng's orders,

235
20:28.240 --> 20:31.299
our troops that advanced to Lishui have all been pulled back.

236
20:48.680 --> 20:50.299
Done fishing for today?

237
20:51.280 --> 20:54.586
Dry the rod, oil it,

238
20:55.360 --> 20:58.396
and put it away properly.

239
20:58.396 --> 20:59.640
We'll use it again later.

240
20:59.640 --> 21:00.640
Got it.

241
21:36.000 --> 21:37.200
I'm not pawning it.

242
21:53.520 --> 21:59.124
Mom, we used to have a jade pendant with a bamboo leaf pattern carved on it.

243
21:59.124 --> 22:00.424
Do you remember?

244
22:02.480 --> 22:04.000
That one?

245
22:04.000 --> 22:08.740
The year before last, the roof leaked and we needed money to fix it, so I pawned it.

246
22:11.240 --> 22:13.433
Why ask about it?

247
22:14.320 --> 22:18.080
I happened to see one today with a similar design,

248
22:18.080 --> 22:19.506
so I thought I'd ask.

249
22:28.000 --> 22:30.280
They're just worldly things.

250
22:30.280 --> 22:31.677
They don't matter.

251
22:31.677 --> 22:36.497
What matters is that you and I live well together.

252
22:44.600 --> 22:47.160
Master Chang Xuan, did you see that?

253
22:47.160 --> 22:50.840
Those old generals looked absolutely livid.

254
22:50.840 --> 22:53.160
There'll be plenty more to make them look even worse.

255
22:53.160 --> 22:55.770
Starting today, the 9th Corps will tighten military discipline

256
22:55.770 --> 22:57.240
and come down hard on violations.

257
22:57.240 --> 22:58.839
We'll set up the Officer's School.

258
22:58.839 --> 23:01.360
Officers at company level and above will undergo regular evaluations.

259
23:01.360 --> 23:03.559
Anyone who fails will be stripped of their post.

260
23:03.559 --> 23:04.800
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

261
23:04.800 --> 23:08.960
Corruption runs rampant among the senior ranks and every rank skims off military funds.

262
23:08.960 --> 23:11.360
Soldiers can't even eat their fill. How can they be loyal?

263
23:11.360 --> 23:14.104
Rui Tong, take the list I gave you

264
23:14.104 --> 23:16.880
and go through these officers' bank records, their family accounts,

265
23:16.880 --> 23:21.024
pawnshop transactions, property leases... everything.

266
23:21.024 --> 23:22.960
- Don't miss a single one. - Understood.

267
23:22.960 --> 23:24.220
Yu Chang Xuan.

268
23:28.920 --> 23:30.220
Oh no.

269
23:30.920 --> 23:32.866
What's coming will come.

270
23:37.840 --> 23:40.680
Zi Yi, what are you doing here?

271
23:40.680 --> 23:43.220
If you'd called me, I would've come and picked you up.

272
23:44.040 --> 23:45.861
Don't bother.

273
23:47.160 --> 23:51.319
Ye Ping Jun hurt my face, so my father stepped in to teach her a lesson.

274
23:51.319 --> 23:56.579
But why did Director Gu take her away?

275
23:58.000 --> 24:02.420
Rui Tong, did this happen?

276
24:03.160 --> 24:04.180
Yes.

277
24:05.800 --> 24:09.560
Director Gu, I find it strange.

278
24:09.560 --> 24:14.893
Tell me, are you really someone a small-time opera singer can order around?

279
24:15.880 --> 24:19.666
Or is this an excuse you made for someone?

280
24:24.160 --> 24:27.480
Miss Zi Yi, you've got that right.

281
24:27.480 --> 24:29.720
It is an excuse.

282
24:29.720 --> 24:32.960
But it's not for Master Chang Xuan.

283
24:32.960 --> 24:34.600
It's Rui Tong's own excuse.

284
24:40.040 --> 24:41.520
What do you mean?

285
24:41.520 --> 24:45.755
At this point, I know I can't hide it from you anymore.

286
24:45.755 --> 24:47.916
I might as well tell you the truth.

287
24:47.916 --> 24:50.593
You're not an outsider, right?

288
24:50.593 --> 24:52.692
Come, let's talk over here.

289
24:58.840 --> 25:05.086
I'll tell you. Rui Tong has had a thing for Miss Ye for a while.

290
25:06.760 --> 25:11.200
Li Bo Ren, are you trying to put one over on me?

291
25:11.200 --> 25:12.640
Why would I lie to you about this?

292
25:12.640 --> 25:14.360
If you don't believe me...

293
25:14.360 --> 25:16.700
Rui Tong, you tell her.

294
25:20.319 --> 25:21.460
Go ahead.

295
25:24.480 --> 25:28.106
Miss Zi Yi, I apologize.

296
25:28.106 --> 25:30.366
I saved Miss Ye for my own reasons.

297
25:33.880 --> 25:37.720
Gu Rui Tong, you hid it from me perfectly.

298
25:37.720 --> 25:39.913
How could you do this, Rui Tong?

299
25:42.680 --> 25:45.440
I acted without orders. Please punish me.

300
25:45.440 --> 25:48.039
Master Chang Xuan, get easy on him, please.

301
25:50.160 --> 25:53.160
Director Gu, I never would've guessed.

302
25:53.160 --> 25:56.000
You're usually all about guns and blades.

303
25:56.000 --> 25:58.560
I've never seen you show interest in any girl.

304
25:58.560 --> 26:01.153
Ye Ping Jun is quite something.

305
26:02.280 --> 26:04.273
As the saying goes,

306
26:04.273 --> 26:09.119
"It's natural for young people to fall in love." Isn't it?

307
26:09.119 --> 26:14.560
Rui Tong just took a little longer than most men to figure it out, didn't he?

308
26:17.560 --> 26:18.766
I don't care.

309
26:20.520 --> 26:23.901
Your man made a mistake, but I can't punish him,

310
26:25.200 --> 26:27.119
so I'm going to punish you.

311
26:27.119 --> 26:28.339
How?

312
26:29.000 --> 26:33.073
You're coming to the movies with me.

313
26:35.280 --> 26:37.101
Pick a time. I'll come pick you up.

314
26:52.599 --> 26:56.799
I had someone bring back fritillary from Sichuan and ground it into powder.

315
26:56.799 --> 26:59.519
I stew it with yellow rock sugar and snow pear.

316
26:59.519 --> 27:02.839
The doctor says a cup a day

317
27:02.839 --> 27:06.233
will soothe your lungs and calm your liver.

318
27:08.759 --> 27:10.059
What's wrong?

319
27:11.480 --> 27:12.480
I'm fine.

320
27:13.080 --> 27:17.440
Then why are you sitting there frowning at this hour?

321
27:17.440 --> 27:19.366
I'm not.

322
27:21.039 --> 27:25.259
Come on, do you really think you and your son can hide anything from me?

323
27:26.039 --> 27:27.336
So tell me,

324
27:27.336 --> 27:32.633
why did you suddenly hand the 9th Corps over to Chang Xuan?

325
27:37.799 --> 27:39.180
Bao Ru.

326
27:41.240 --> 27:46.540
There are things you don't know.

327
27:54.240 --> 27:56.321
Why tell me now?

328
27:57.000 --> 28:00.000
Is it because you just found out yourself

329
28:00.000 --> 28:05.720
that Chang Xuan has known all along his own father gave up on him,

330
28:05.720 --> 28:10.500
so you're not hiding it from me anymore?

331
28:13.799 --> 28:18.720
Ming Xuan was your eldest son, the heir you groomed.

332
28:18.720 --> 28:20.920
You wouldn't let him die.

333
28:20.920 --> 28:23.133
But when it was Chang Xuan's life on the line,

334
28:23.840 --> 28:27.755
you gave up on him.

335
28:27.755 --> 28:31.320
In that situation, I could only save one person.

336
28:31.320 --> 28:34.636
So I chose to save the future commander of the Yu Army.

337
28:34.636 --> 28:36.913
Who to save was no longer a matter between father and son.

338
28:37.520 --> 28:40.101
It was a matter of war, and of politics.

339
28:50.880 --> 28:55.219
Our marriage, a military-political alliance, has been almost 30 years.

340
28:57.160 --> 29:02.480
Your position, your difficulties, your coldness...

341
29:02.480 --> 29:04.465
I see them all clearly.

342
29:04.465 --> 29:07.600
I don't complain about it, nor do I dwell on it.

343
29:07.600 --> 29:10.458
I am a mother.

344
29:10.458 --> 29:16.373
I only hope we can show our children more care.

345
29:17.680 --> 29:22.600
But to the entire Yu Army, to Nanhuai City,

346
29:22.600 --> 29:26.359
we have to be the Commander and his wife first.

347
29:26.359 --> 29:31.980
Only within these walls can we be father and mother.

348
30:06.440 --> 30:11.313
[Guanyin Pavilion]

349
30:20.200 --> 30:23.079
Dad, I'm here to see you.

350
30:23.079 --> 30:24.559
School finished late today.

351
30:24.559 --> 30:26.380
I hope you weren't waiting too long.

352
30:27.360 --> 30:30.920
Yesterday evening, I heard some kids singing outside our door.

353
30:30.920 --> 30:32.680
[Ye Ping Jun in her youth] It was really lovely.

354
30:33.519 --> 30:37.400
My Chinese literature teacher read my poem in class.

355
30:37.400 --> 30:41.193
He said I had real talent and encouraged me to keep writing.

356
30:41.759 --> 30:46.539
Maybe one day, I'll see my writing in the newspapers.

357
30:56.119 --> 30:59.840
Dad, I miss you so much.

358
31:41.360 --> 31:42.557
See that?

359
31:42.557 --> 31:44.280
[Spirit Tablet of Eldest Brother Yu Ming Xuan]

360
31:44.280 --> 31:45.820
Whatever you could do,

361
31:46.758 --> 31:48.186
I can do too.

362
31:49.920 --> 31:51.920
And I will do it better.

363
31:53.600 --> 31:55.340
Watch closely.

364
31:56.800 --> 32:01.860
Watch me take Sujing step by step.

365
32:20.840 --> 32:24.793
Yu Ming Xuan, why did you have to die like that?

366
32:25.519 --> 32:27.240
We never settled who was better.

367
32:27.240 --> 32:29.960
[Yu Chang Xuan, 17 years old] I never showed Father I'm better than you.

368
32:29.960 --> 32:32.604
You're a coward.

369
32:32.604 --> 32:35.259
You were just afraid I'd surpass you.

370
32:48.880 --> 32:52.460
Dad, I miss you so much.

371
32:54.359 --> 32:58.339
I know you've become the brightest star in the sky,

372
32:59.079 --> 33:03.140
staying by our side, never really gone.

373
33:04.920 --> 33:07.759
All self-deceiving nonsense.

374
33:07.759 --> 33:10.119
When someone's dead, they're dead.

375
33:10.119 --> 33:14.140
Turned to ashes. Nothing left.

376
33:25.760 --> 33:27.846
Are you here to remember someone you love?

377
33:29.440 --> 33:32.506
No, I hate him.

378
33:34.880 --> 33:37.040
If you hated him,

379
33:37.040 --> 33:39.040
why light an eternal lamp for him?

380
33:44.160 --> 33:45.786
You miss him, don't you?

381
33:46.440 --> 33:48.599
He was someone you loved very much.

382
33:48.599 --> 33:49.660
No, I don't.

383
33:52.240 --> 33:53.299
I don't love him.

384
34:04.120 --> 34:06.459
This little yellow flower is beautiful.

385
34:08.000 --> 34:09.980
I can tell it was picked with care.

386
34:20.760 --> 34:25.019
Pretending not to love someone is painful.

387
34:49.760 --> 34:51.659
"Their body returns to dust,

388
34:53.159 --> 34:55.219
but our feelings for them never fade."

389
35:06.320 --> 35:07.480
One!

390
35:07.480 --> 35:08.599
Kill!

391
35:08.599 --> 35:09.719
Two!

392
35:09.719 --> 35:11.340
- Kill! - Left face!

393
35:12.119 --> 35:13.440
Greetings, Corps Commander.

394
35:13.440 --> 35:14.539
Fire!

395
35:17.960 --> 35:19.140
Don't move!

396
35:26.840 --> 35:27.986
Keep up!

397
35:30.160 --> 35:31.540
Come on, lift it.

398
35:32.639 --> 35:34.153
Greetings, Corps Commander.

399
35:38.239 --> 35:40.260
- What are you doing? - Don't move!

400
35:43.000 --> 35:44.381
Greetings, Corps Commander.

401
35:51.360 --> 35:52.893
What are you doing? Guards!

402
35:53.480 --> 35:55.113
Let me go!

403
35:56.120 --> 35:57.669
What the hell is this?

404
35:57.669 --> 35:59.643
Can't even make sense of it.

405
35:59.643 --> 36:00.880
What on earth is this?

406
36:00.880 --> 36:02.360
Kill!

407
36:02.360 --> 36:04.099
One, two, one.

408
36:09.600 --> 36:12.880
Ping Jun, how's the wound healing?

409
36:12.880 --> 36:14.720
Almost healed.

410
36:14.720 --> 36:18.184
Lan Qing, thank you for getting Director Gu to save me.

411
36:18.184 --> 36:22.300
Otherwise, I couldn't imagine how to get out of there in one piece.

412
36:22.960 --> 36:24.980
Why are you being so polite with me?

413
36:30.440 --> 36:33.837
But Ping Jun, after you quit,

414
36:33.837 --> 36:36.297
I don't even have anyone to share my secrets with.

415
36:39.679 --> 36:42.659
Don't worry, I'll come see you often.

416
36:46.280 --> 36:47.579
I'll see you out.

417
36:49.039 --> 36:50.199
You can't just leave!

418
36:50.199 --> 36:52.120
How can you walk out halfway through?

419
36:52.120 --> 36:53.679
That's irresponsible!

420
36:53.679 --> 36:55.040
It's not that I'm walking out.

421
36:55.040 --> 36:57.280
They sent threatening letters to my home.

422
36:57.280 --> 36:58.960
I have no choice.

423
36:58.960 --> 37:01.340
Find someone else.

424
37:02.960 --> 37:05.440
Ruo Ru, let him go.

425
37:05.440 --> 37:07.280
- Director Liang. - Ruo Ru.

426
37:07.280 --> 37:09.357
- Lan Qing. - What happened?

427
37:09.357 --> 37:12.560
There's a group of people fled to the outskirts of Nanhuai City.

428
37:12.560 --> 37:16.197
The Charity Union will vote on whether to take them in.

429
37:16.197 --> 37:19.000
We were going to hold a benefit performance to win votes in favor,

430
37:19.000 --> 37:21.440
but Chu Yuan was threatened and doesn't dare write the script.

431
37:21.440 --> 37:23.400
Alright, let's not talk about it.

432
37:24.080 --> 37:26.520
He was threatened, after all.

433
37:26.520 --> 37:28.040
I understand.

434
37:28.040 --> 37:32.310
By the way, Director Liang, didn't Miss Ye help us with the script before?

435
37:32.310 --> 37:34.600
Her writing and her ideas were both better.

436
37:34.600 --> 37:36.940
Could you help us out this time?

437
37:43.680 --> 37:46.597
Ping Jun has her own things to do.

438
37:46.597 --> 37:50.639
If the motion is voted down this week, those refugees will be driven away.

439
37:50.639 --> 37:53.200
Most of them are elderly people, women, and kids.

440
37:53.200 --> 37:54.840
Once homeless, they won't last long.

441
37:54.840 --> 37:57.760
Ruo Ru, don't put Miss Ye on the spot.

442
37:57.760 --> 38:00.276
We'll figure something out ourselves.

443
38:00.276 --> 38:02.079
I'll pawn something.

444
38:02.079 --> 38:03.760
Even if it's just a drop in the bucket,

445
38:03.760 --> 38:06.386
at least it'll settle the refugees a few more days.

446
38:07.360 --> 38:09.599
- All right, we'll get going. - Let's go.

447
38:09.599 --> 38:10.780
Director Liang.

448
38:15.920 --> 38:17.360
I want to give it a try.

449
38:20.640 --> 38:22.160
Aren't you afraid?

450
38:22.160 --> 38:26.480
Dangerous but worthwhile things have to be done.

451
38:26.480 --> 38:31.820
These refugees lost their homes and their loved ones to the war.

452
38:33.080 --> 38:36.821
I want to do something to see if I can help them.

453
38:53.559 --> 38:54.780
Come in.

454
39:00.400 --> 39:01.400
Father.

455
39:04.719 --> 39:05.739
Father.

456
39:09.440 --> 39:11.152
Impressive.

457
39:11.152 --> 39:16.413
Even Master Cheng's people are speaking and acting for you now.

458
39:17.360 --> 39:21.560
Your reach is long, and it goes high.

459
39:21.560 --> 39:25.236
If you want to get ahead, you need friends in high places.

460
39:25.236 --> 39:28.239
But this is playing with fire.

461
39:28.239 --> 39:33.679
You exposed Chu Wen Fu, but you also exposed yourself to Master Cheng.

462
39:33.679 --> 39:36.960
Master Cheng's people are sharp.

463
39:36.960 --> 39:41.219
One wrong move and they can catch you on,

464
39:42.120 --> 39:43.784
and it's checkmate.

465
39:43.784 --> 39:45.680
Back when you took Nanhuai,

466
39:45.680 --> 39:49.440
were you this careful, this cautious with every word?

467
39:49.440 --> 39:50.720
Arrogant!

468
39:50.720 --> 39:53.744
Now you can't even take my advice?

469
39:53.744 --> 39:54.744
I wouldn't dare.

470
39:56.199 --> 40:00.460
It's just that you've rarely guided before.

471
40:01.360 --> 40:02.700
I'm not used to it.

472
40:09.040 --> 40:10.181
Come here.

473
40:16.720 --> 40:18.483
You see this map?

474
40:18.483 --> 40:21.680
To our northeast is Chu Wen Fu.

475
40:21.680 --> 40:23.760
To the southwest, the Mou Army.

476
40:23.760 --> 40:27.893
Here's the Jing Army, and here's the Northwest Army.

477
40:27.893 --> 40:31.432
Nanhuai is surrounded.

478
40:32.199 --> 40:35.639
They used to see you as a good-for-nothing.

479
40:35.639 --> 40:37.840
But now you're their rival.

480
40:37.840 --> 40:40.000
You're walking a tightrope,

481
40:40.000 --> 40:42.599
and below you is nothing but a flood of dangers.

482
40:42.599 --> 40:46.280
So you must never underestimate them.

483
40:46.280 --> 40:48.800
Never let your guard down.

484
40:48.800 --> 40:49.940
Understand?

485
40:54.880 --> 40:55.880
Master Chang Xuan.

486
40:57.793 --> 40:59.560
We've looked into disciplinary violations.

487
40:59.560 --> 41:02.297
Three regiment commanders embezzled these military funds.

488
41:02.297 --> 41:05.360
It goes down to 21 company and platoon leaders.

489
41:05.360 --> 41:06.880
Keep digging.

490
41:06.880 --> 41:10.000
That's far from all the dirty business they've been up to.

491
41:10.000 --> 41:11.186
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

492
41:21.719 --> 41:24.260
Well, something just came to mind.

493
41:25.599 --> 41:26.699
Go on.

494
41:27.480 --> 41:30.613
It's about your little sweetheart, she...

495
41:31.920 --> 41:33.260
What's with that look?

496
41:36.360 --> 41:38.000
Alright, "Miss Ye."

497
41:38.000 --> 41:42.861
I heard she formally put in her resignation to Lan Qing,

498
41:46.920 --> 41:52.200
but at Liang Wen Bo's warm invitation,

499
41:52.200 --> 41:53.730
she stayed.

500
41:53.730 --> 41:56.639
Well, guess Director Liang's name does carry weight.

501
41:56.639 --> 42:00.059
As they say, "like a spring breeze that warms the heart."

502
42:01.200 --> 42:02.972
Li Bo Ren, don't you have anything serious to do?

503
42:02.972 --> 42:06.440
Isn't this a serious matter?

504
42:06.440 --> 42:08.840
Right, that reminds me.

505
42:08.840 --> 42:11.880
Weren't you supposed to have dinner with that arms dealer today?

506
42:11.880 --> 42:13.760
- Ro... - Robert.

507
42:13.760 --> 42:15.480
Right, "Robert Chen."

508
42:15.480 --> 42:16.960
Weren't you inviting him to dinner?

509
42:16.960 --> 42:20.000
He wanted Baosheng Restaurant, but there were no good private rooms left,

510
42:20.000 --> 42:25.440
so I moved it to Xiangxi Hotel.

511
42:25.440 --> 42:26.440
How's that?

512
42:30.640 --> 42:34.640
Master Chang Xuan, we'll send you another 200 Mauser C96s from Germany.

513
42:34.640 --> 42:37.239
I'll notify you immediately the moment they reach port.

514
42:37.239 --> 42:38.720
Thank you.

515
42:38.720 --> 42:41.520
It's my honor to do business with you, Master Chang Xuan.

516
42:41.520 --> 42:45.570
The firearms experts you need will arrive in Nanhuai and start work as soon as possible.

517
42:45.570 --> 42:49.240
I appreciate the trouble. Rui Tong, see Mr. Robert out.

518
42:49.240 --> 42:51.601
Thank you. I look forward to our next meeting.

519
42:52.200 --> 42:53.200
This way, please.

520
42:56.520 --> 42:59.060
So? Pretty good result, right?

521
42:59.840 --> 43:03.800
Master Chang Xuan, is everything settled?

522
43:03.800 --> 43:05.139
What brings you here?

523
43:05.960 --> 43:09.384
I've had a few dishes prepared, and I got a black fox fur cloak recently.

524
43:09.384 --> 43:10.563
I'd like you to try it on.

525
43:11.720 --> 43:13.283
I'm not short on things like that.

526
43:13.283 --> 43:14.720
Why go to the expense?

527
43:14.720 --> 43:17.440
What expense? Everything I earn comes from you, doesn't it?

528
43:17.440 --> 43:18.716
Come on.

529
43:18.716 --> 43:20.520
Let's take a look.

530
43:20.520 --> 43:23.196
Do I get to come too?

531
43:23.196 --> 43:24.960
- Let's go together. - Alright.

532
43:37.320 --> 43:39.900
It's this late and the troupe's still working?

533
43:40.880 --> 43:42.680
They've been out early and back late lately.

534
43:42.680 --> 43:45.541
Seems they're preparing an important performance.

535
43:55.280 --> 43:56.766
Ping Jun, look.

536
43:57.360 --> 44:00.519
I've added another set of contrast here.

537
44:00.519 --> 44:02.039
What do you think?

538
44:02.039 --> 44:04.840
With the contrast between going to war and not going to war,

539
44:04.840 --> 44:09.119
the play's focus stands out more, and the emotion feels stronger too.

540
44:09.119 --> 44:12.120
Well said. You get me. That's what I meant.

541
44:12.120 --> 44:13.697
- Am I right? - Yes.

542
44:14.280 --> 44:19.019
For the next scene, I want him to say this line at the school gate.

543
44:20.000 --> 44:21.460
Let me see.

544
44:22.480 --> 44:24.579
Director Liang. Ping Jun.

545
44:26.480 --> 44:27.639
Lan Qing.

546
44:27.639 --> 44:29.900
Master Chang Xuan. Advisor Li.

547
44:33.960 --> 44:36.320
Liang Wen Bo. Ye Ping Jun.

548
44:36.320 --> 44:39.276
What are you two doing here this late?

549
44:39.276 --> 44:40.920
We're revising the script.

550
44:40.920 --> 44:43.420
What kind of play is worth revising all night?

551
44:45.520 --> 44:47.419
What are you looking at? Say it.

552
44:48.480 --> 44:51.640
Fine, then let me ask you, where's everyone else?

553
44:51.640 --> 44:53.404
Just the two of you, alone here?

554
44:53.404 --> 44:56.480
The stage area lost power earlier, so the other actors went home.

555
44:56.480 --> 44:59.480
Ping Jun and I stayed to revise the script.

556
44:59.480 --> 45:03.300
I think you're just using it as an excuse to fool around.

557
45:04.600 --> 45:06.144
We are just working.

558
45:06.144 --> 45:07.560
We're completely innocent.

559
45:07.560 --> 45:10.657
A filthy mind sees filth everywhere.

560
45:10.657 --> 45:13.679
I'm filthy? Is she serious?

561
45:13.679 --> 45:17.820
When we went boating, you almost wanted to stand outside the boat,

562
45:18.600 --> 45:23.070
going on about how a man and woman alone in a room would ruin the latter's reputation.

563
45:23.070 --> 45:25.211
But now, you forget about your reputation.

564
45:28.280 --> 45:32.340
Seems you have two faces, Miss Ye.

565
45:34.400 --> 45:36.246
With a gentleman,

566
45:37.120 --> 45:39.533
there's naturally no need to worry about reputation.
